{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotrix \u2013 A New Kind of Trolling Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cunning strategy, precise control, and a variety of skill combinations to sabotage your enemies' operations and bring down those who seek to corrupt the Matrix World!<br><br><i>Sabotrix</i> is a 2D pixel art trolling game that blends strategy and puzzle elements.<br>Players must combine various skills, traits, strategies, and precise controls to disrupt the AI as it tries to stack blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict the AI\u2019s movements and block its path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a cast of unique characters with distinct abilities, and take on new challenges by unlocking fresh stages!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874640?t=1761624533","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874640?t=1761624533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874640/4f90009f0287e0bedb5f5ab421bbf57ba50ade51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761624533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874640/4f90009f0287e0bedb5f5ab421bbf57ba50ade51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761624533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotrix \u2013 A New Kind of Trolling Game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cunning strategy, precise control, and a variety of skill combinations to sabotage your enemies' operations and bring down those who seek to corrupt the Matrix World!<br><br><i>Sabotrix</i> is a 2D pixel art trolling game that blends strategy and puzzle elements.<b